version: 1.1.1
date: 07-04-2026
changes:
- Booking:
  - Added booking creation endpoints for both admin and user flows.
  - Booking creation now returns the created booking object instead of only a success message.
  - Implemented booking assignment to technical teams.
  - Added Telegram notifications for booking updates, customer alerts, and admin alerts.
  - Added technical report submission and approval flow.

- User:
  - Added user authentication, registration, and profile management.
  - Added user vehicle registration and booking history support.
  - Added OTP-based login request and verification flow with Telegram delivery.

- Admin:
  - Added admin login, profile, and admin management endpoints.
  - Added admin-level category, product, and inventory management.
  - Added Telegram deep-link generation for admin account linking and notifications.

- Technical Staff:
  - Added technical staff login and self-management endpoints.
  - Added technical job assignment, status updates, and team-specific booking views.
  - Added Telegram notifications for technicians when reports are approved or booking status changes.

- Category/Product/Inventory:
  - Added CRUD APIs for categories and products.
  - Added inventory endpoints for stock retrieval, direct stock updates, restocking, deductions, and low-stock alerts.

- Telegram Integration:
  - Implemented Telegram bot integration for user OTP delivery, booking notifications, and admin alerts.
  - Added deep-link generation for admin account linking and notifications.
